OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader accused of
OL,4,A'ridicule' in memorial row
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group looking to create a memorial to
OL,7,Fvolunteers who fought against fascism
OL,8,Fin the Spanish Civil War has accused a
OL,9,Fcouncil leader of "childish ridicule".
OL,11,FAbout 20 people from Roker, Millfield,
OL,12,FSouthwick and other parts of Sunderland
OL,13,Fare believed to have travelled to Spain
OL,14,Fto fight against the nationalists. Some
OL,15,Fwere members of the Communist Party.
OL,17,FChris Eynon, leader of the Reform-run
OL,18,Flocal authority, said he had "no plans
OL,19,Ffor statues of Marxist fighters" in
OL,20,Fresponse to a public question about the
OL,21,Fproject at last week's council meeting.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
